{"v":4,"catch":"與世界上最年輕的超級英雄 Pajama Sam 一起前往天空中的風暴工廠！","desc":"因為對雷暴的恐懼, Sam在沙發下已蜷縮了太多個晚上。於是他決定走上雲層之上克服它。正當他在天空中的風暴工廠開始了解到暴風雨並不像看起來那麼糟糕時，他不小心擾亂了天氣系統。\n現在他需要你的幫助來探索這奇妙的空中世界和修理損壞的機器，讓世界的天氣得以恢復正常！","publisher":"UFO Interactive","release":"2022-02-10","genres":["冒險","學習"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.3GB / Switch 0.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d1637366070be4b7f42ac8db9d93715dde34fee6ae4cd022491c5e6aa0064c35.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f2287e99fd621655ecfbcd049c84ba4d034eaba9353652af7aec3493e5c173e4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1865a4acd99157aad65aedd2031c9c89be641285fd35926691c49b6c51f5399a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ccd57c63fb88fa0621e5ca9730202b204755fe20ab6b70df8f69f12095743d6f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/26cf03355c66394908a3d8d74564d78ce0669b708a37e0702925e7eed3572acd.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/618b401adedd1d76bce8d4c7379b4d6c1f8a951adc2e56d3418d66a9a2369658.jpg"],"titleId":"0100ec9013834000","dlc":[]}